(7565716, 1213593, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fake, because the idea that a photographer can pull off posing as a mote is implausible.  A yak or refrigerator, maybe, a photographer, no.<br/> <br/>While interesting on its face (no pun intended, really), what intrigues me is the rather flat Caucasian skin tone background.  This sets off the eye in a surreal fashion.  It seems to float in space, taking on its own individual existence.  Weird.</td>', 'Fake, because the idea that a photographer can pull off posing as a mote is implausible.  A yak or refrigerator, maybe, a photographer, no. While interesting on its face (no pun intended, really), what intrigues me is the rather flat Caucasian skin tone background.  This sets off the eye in a surreal fashion.  It seems to float in space, taking on its own individual existence.  Weird.', '2018-04-12 14:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
