(7565727, 1213591, 173844, '<td valign="top">Real, and a threat to picnickers everywhere.  A forewarning of the havoc wrought by the chemical assault on the environment, a nefarious harvest of sadness and hand-wringing.  Look out for Siamese hedgehogs, hippopotami, fire ants and velociraptors.<br/> <br/>Real, and a nice capture.  Perhaps a small crop from a larger image.  Perspective can be everything.  The tail sure looks as one.  The sparkle on the water sets the birds off well.</td>', 'Real, and a threat to picnickers everywhere.  A forewarning of the havoc wrought by the chemical assault on the environment, a nefarious harvest of sadness and hand-wringing.  Look out for Siamese hedgehogs, hippopotami, fire ants and velociraptors. Real, and a nice capture.  Perhaps a small crop from a larger image.  Perspective can be everything.  The tail sure looks as one.  The sparkle on the water sets the birds off well.', '2018-04-12 15:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
