(7565811, 1213458, 173844, '<td valign="top">Obviously fake, because someone would certainly notice that bomb at the bottom center of the image, so where''s the swat team?<br/> <br/>But really, this is so slickly achieved (I''ve no idea how) with the switcheroo of the bikes and storefront.  And so lovingly pedestrian.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Obviously fake, because someone would certainly notice that bomb at the bottom center of the image, so where''s the swat team? But really, this is so slickly achieved (I''ve no idea how) with the switcheroo of the bikes and storefront.  And so lovingly pedestrian.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2018-04-12 22:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7565812, 1213488, 173844, '<td valign="top">Real, because there seems to be a conspiracy afoot, and I believe in conspiracies over rational journalism any day.<br/> <br/>Actually, I can''t tell.  The flame looks phony as it''s presented, more like a movie explosion.  The overall stylish noirish atmosphere is very enjoyable.  The composition is nicely balanced.</td>', 'Real, because there seems to be a conspiracy afoot, and I believe in conspiracies over rational journalism any day. Actually, I can''t tell.  The flame looks phony as it''s presented, more like a movie explosion.  The overall stylish noirish atmosphere is very enjoyable.  The composition is nicely balanced.', '2018-04-12 22:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7565813, 1213470, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fake, because if a motorcyclist had really landed in the upper level like this it would have gone viral and might even be featured on a postage stamp; also, the Dessert Bar is way too sparsely utilized.<br/> <br/>Back on planet Earth, I have no idea.  Kinda think it''s real.  It''s rather surreal, with the restaurant packed and the stands empty, and tumbling motorcyclists.  I like the overall weirdness of it.</td>', 'Fake, because if a motorcyclist had really landed in the upper level like this it would have gone viral and might even be featured on a postage stamp; also, the Dessert Bar is way too sparsely utilized. Back on planet Earth, I have no idea.  Kinda think it''s real.  It''s rather surreal, with the restaurant packed and the stands empty, and tumbling motorcyclists.  I like the overall weirdness of it.', '2018-04-12 22:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7565814, 1213584, 173844, '<td valign="top">Real, because I''ve heard of human trafficking, but then again the booth looks like soda machine.<br/> <br/>Clever and well-done, and the sepia nicely conveys an historical documentary feel, but --  it doesn''t walk the thin line that the challenge seems to be asking to be walked, real or manufactured, because this is obviously a put on image.  Quite a few photos are like this, and I''m only saying this now because it''s my highest rated of them and the first to pop up.  I like the image.</td>', 'Real, because I''ve heard of human trafficking, but then again the booth looks like soda machine. Clever and well-done, and the sepia nicely conveys an historical documentary feel, but --  it doesn''t walk the thin line that the challenge seems to be asking to be walked, real or manufactured, because this is obviously a put on image.  Quite a few photos are like this, and I''m only saying this now because it''s my highest rated of them and the first to pop up.  I like the image.', '2018-04-12 22:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7565815, 1213586, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fake, because we all know that poverty and homelessness have been vanquished in modern America, along with racism and tooth decay.<br/> <br/>Looks real to me, and it''s a fine image, off-balanced (commentary?) yet interestingly composed.  I''d even say that the main subject is the mood.</td>', 'Fake, because we all know that poverty and homelessness have been vanquished in modern America, along with racism and tooth decay. Looks real to me, and it''s a fine image, off-balanced (commentary?) yet interestingly composed.  I''d even say that the main subject is the mood.', '2018-04-12 22:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
