(7565826, 1213599, 173844, '<td valign="top">I''d say one in thirty-four.  Unless, due to evolutionary happenstance, these are fish, similar in appearance to homo sapiens, which carry about their oxygen supply in modified gills.  In that case, real.<br/> <br/>Baffled.  Flits back and forth across the line.  Maybe this is real and set up.  They seem to be enjoying their roles is this charade.  I like the close focus on the woman in front.</td>', 'I''d say one in thirty-four.  Unless, due to evolutionary happenstance, these are fish, similar in appearance to homo sapiens, which carry about their oxygen supply in modified gills.  In that case, real. Baffled.  Flits back and forth across the line.  Maybe this is real and set up.  They seem to be enjoying their roles is this charade.  I like the close focus on the woman in front.', '2018-04-12 22:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7565827, 1213606, 173844, '<td valign="top">Real. This is an electron microscope image of Maxwell Planck''s cerebellum, as evidenced in the foreground by his preoccupation with Planck''s Constant.  In the background we can see a vivid example of electron entanglement, which Einstein called "spooky action at a distance."  Sure ''nuff.<br/> <br/>I guess this is real, unless those trees in background are actually broccoli stalks. Mysterious and unfocused, I''m waiting to hear more.</td>', 'Real. This is an electron microscope image of Maxwell Planck''s cerebellum, as evidenced in the foreground by his preoccupation with Planck''s Constant.  In the background we can see a vivid example of electron entanglement, which Einstein called "spooky action at a distance."  Sure ''nuff. I guess this is real, unless those trees in background are actually broccoli stalks. Mysterious and unfocused, I''m waiting to hear more.', '2018-04-12 22:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7565828, 1213479, 173844, '<td valign="top">Gonna go with photoshop, because the human hand hasn''t the deftness required to produce the stippled effect of the background.  Oh, maybe with a stipulator, but that technically wouldn''t be the direct art of the hand.<br/> <br/>A tossup, as both are possible.  Interesting view of these two lizards, a moment in time.  If they are pets, I think it wise to zip their mouths shut, as they''re capable of quite the nip.</td>', 'Gonna go with photoshop, because the human hand hasn''t the deftness required to produce the stippled effect of the background.  Oh, maybe with a stipulator, but that technically wouldn''t be the direct art of the hand. A tossup, as both are possible.  Interesting view of these two lizards, a moment in time.  If they are pets, I think it wise to zip their mouths shut, as they''re capable of quite the nip.', '2018-04-12 22:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7565829, 1213518, 173844, '<td valign="top">Obviously fake, because in my experience I''ve never had to take a staircase to cross over that eastern tower of the Brooklyn Bridge.<br/> <br/>Looks real enough, but I''ve never fully trusted those devious Brooklynites.  When I lived there for a few years I didn''t even trust myself.  What could be up this photographer''s sleeve?<br/>I like the gray and russet bridge, with it''s glorious tangle of cables, against the steely blue sky and skyline.  It''s quite evocative.  Nice.</td>', 'Obviously fake, because in my experience I''ve never had to take a staircase to cross over that eastern tower of the Brooklyn Bridge. Looks real enough, but I''ve never fully trusted those devious Brooklynites.  When I lived there for a few years I didn''t even trust myself.  What could be up this photographer''s sleeve?I like the gray and russet bridge, with it''s glorious tangle of cables, against the steely blue sky and skyline.  It''s quite evocative.  Nice.', '2018-04-12 22:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
