(7565837, 1213587, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fake, because there''s nobody in front of that device of which to capture an image.  And I don''t believe in ectoplasm, except at night, and this is clearly daytime.<br/> <br/>Don''t know.  Why take this unexceptional image if not to mess with our minds?  And so I find it mystifying, and a personal provocation.  Just kidding.  I''m cool.  I like the black and white treatment, especially of her blond hair and splayed hand.</td>', 'Fake, because there''s nobody in front of that device of which to capture an image.  And I don''t believe in ectoplasm, except at night, and this is clearly daytime. Don''t know.  Why take this unexceptional image if not to mess with our minds?  And so I find it mystifying, and a personal provocation.  Just kidding.  I''m cool.  I like the black and white treatment, especially of her blond hair and splayed hand.', '2018-04-12 23:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7565838, 1213437, 173844, '<td valign="top">Real, as since ancient times we have been receiving coded messages in our coffee from aliens -- from outer space, that is.  This one, in Sumerian,  advises us to never walk under ladders.  Recently a Persian shepherd in the Zagros Mountains received a message, written in Finnish, implying that whistling while you work is quite likely counterproductive.<br/> <br/>Real, as what can''t baristas do.  Creamy image nicely set off by the dark blue background.</td>', 'Real, as since ancient times we have been receiving coded messages in our coffee from aliens -- from outer space, that is.  This one, in Sumerian,  advises us to never walk under ladders.  Recently a Persian shepherd in the Zagros Mountains received a message, written in Finnish, implying that whistling while you work is quite likely counterproductive. Real, as what can''t baristas do.  Creamy image nicely set off by the dark blue background.', '2018-04-12 23:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7565839, 1213560, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fake, because the mongoose and the Irish elk do not exist together in the wild.  Also, the mongoose is extinct.<br/> <br/>Interesting.  The leftmost squirrel and the background trees are throwing sharp shadows, whereas the deer aren''t.  I like how this image straddles the line but allows for detective work to possibly avail.  A happy day in the park.</td>', 'Fake, because the mongoose and the Irish elk do not exist together in the wild.  Also, the mongoose is extinct. Interesting.  The leftmost squirrel and the background trees are throwing sharp shadows, whereas the deer aren''t.  I like how this image straddles the line but allows for detective work to possibly avail.  A happy day in the park.', '2018-04-12 23:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7565840, 1213594, 94815, '<td valign="top">I think the figure up top is photoshopped, but the effect is very artistic and makes the shot. A top pick,</td>', 'I think the figure up top is photoshopped, but the effect is very artistic and makes the shot. A top pick,', '2018-04-12 23:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7565841, 1213584, 94815, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of checkpoint Charlie in Berlin but not quite. Quite a fanciful construction and definitely not real. Nice photoshopping and a top pick by me.</td>', 'This reminds me of checkpoint Charlie in Berlin but not quite. Quite a fanciful construction and definitely not real. Nice photoshopping and a top pick by me.', '2018-04-12 23:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7565844, 1213518, 94815, '<td valign="top">Fancy Photoshopping, not with anything added but much enhanced for maximum visual effect. Real or not is in the eye of the beholder. I would say not real because Brooklyn never looked so good.</td>', 'Fancy Photoshopping, not with anything added but much enhanced for maximum visual effect. Real or not is in the eye of the beholder. I would say not real because Brooklyn never looked so good.', '2018-04-12 23:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
